              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Article 3 -->
          <div class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
            <div class="aspect-video bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 relative">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center">
                <span class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">Image de l'article</span>
              </div>
              <div class="absolute top-4 left-4">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 bg-[var(--color-primary-700)]/80 text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full">
                  Conseils pro
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-5">
              <div class="flex items-center mb-2">
                <span class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">5 mars 2025</span>
              </div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
                <a href="/blog/optimiser-rotation-stock">
                  5 stratégies pour optimiser la rotation de votre stock
                </a>
              </h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 mb-3 text-sm">
                Méthodes éprouvées pour accélérer la vente et maximiser la rentabilité de votre parc.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Newsletter -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-gray-50 dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 shadow-sm border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700">
